Package: rangecondprob
Title: Range Conditional Probability
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: person("Kim Man", "Lui", email = "cskmlui@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Streamline the calculation of conditional probabilities for various numeric ranges in an R DataFrame. This method automates the need to convert numerical data into categorical data for these calculations, making it ideal for quick and preliminary data analysis. 
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends: R (>= 3.0.0), dplyr
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/kimmanlui/calc_cond_prob
BugReports: https://github.com/kimmanlui/calc_cond_prob/issues
